		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Stout, green dragons with smooth, scaleless hide and ectoplasmic flesh. Diet consists of incorporeal creatures. Ethereal dweller.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 grave breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Ethereal</strong>. Can harm incorporeal creatures.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grave Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from dragon. CON 15+ or reduced to 0 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal Flight</strong>. When flying, becomes incorporeal.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
